# First UNX desktop GUI test
open window "My First UNX App"
set window width to "800"
set window height to "500"

say "Welcome to UNX!"
say "This window was created by a .unxc script."
say "Press ESC to close the window."

set greeting to "Hello from a clicked UNX button!"
button "Say hello" say greeting
button "About UNX" say "UNX GUI buttons are experimental."
